br>- Total charge for loan: $1,000 * 0.20 (20% APR) = $200<br>- Total amount you&#39;ll repay: $1,000 + $200 = $1,200<br>- Monthly payment: $1,200 / 12 = $100<br><br>We thank you for using our Borrow Money App.",
